          "iast": "mehino balinaḥ kuryādādau vamanarecane | snigdhasya sarṣapāriṣṭanikumbhākṣakarañjajaiḥ || 1 || tailastrikaṇṭakādyena yathāsvaṃ sādhitena vā | snehena mustadevāhvanāgaraprativāpavat || 2 || surasādikaṣāyeṇa dadyādāsthāpanaṃ tataḥ | nyagrodhādestu pittārtaṃ rasaiḥ śuddhaṃ ca tarpayet || 3 ||",
